# Dice duel

::: var you default=0
::: var them default=0
::: var roll default=0
::: var ready default=false

You {{you}} | Them {{them}} | Last roll {{roll}}

::: button "Roll (or press R)"
put roll = random(6)
add you roll
put them = random(6) + them
:::

::: key r
put roll = random(6)
add you roll
put them = random(6) + them
:::

<!-- if: you >= 15 and you > them -->
## You win!

<!-- if: them >= 15 and them >= you -->
## They win!

::: button "Play again"
reset
:::

::: when you >= 15
goto 2
:::

---

# Game over

Final: you {{you}}, them {{them}}.

::: button "Back"
goto 1
:::
